      "machineText": "Tipe bawaan Wails — `Screen`, `Rect`, `Point`, `Size`, `EnvironmentInfo`, `OSInfo`, `Capabilities` — sudah memiliki tag. Anda hanya perlu menambahkan tag ke tipe Anda sendiri.",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "Wails's own types — `Screen`, `Rect`, `Point`, `Size`, `EnvironmentInfo`, `OSInfo`, `Capabilities` —…",
